 ### Veterinarian directory
 
-<a id="req-vet-001"></a>
+<a id="req-vet-001"></a><a id="req-vet-003"></a>
 
 The clinic publishes the veterinarians it employs with the specialties each holds, listed a page at a time. A veterinarian holding no specialty is shown as having none rather than left blank `[REQ-VET-001]`.
 
+A specialty directory answers the inverse question for staff: which veterinarians hold this specialty. It lists every specialty the clinic knows, by its stored name, each with the veterinarians holding it by full name. All specialties appear on one page. The directory is read-only and lists specialties, not the full veterinarian roster. It is reachable by its address alone, with no navigation entry and no link from another page `[REQ-VET-003]`.
